The Undertable is a pawn shop in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Star 12/index|Star 12]], tucked away where it draws little attention. [[Smiler]] keeps the counter as both pawnbroker and fence, dealing in radios, tools, firearms and whatever else is carried in. The party comes here when it wants to buy or sell without a paper trail.
